 (no marker) — that's what sop had (r4 from c3 to c4).\nc5 declarative aux do negation not verb want subject n6 \"I\"; relation \"to\" → c6 nonfinite verb change subject n7 \"it\".\nk1 coordination \"and\" conjunct c3 conjunct c5.\nr1 marker \"because\" from c1 to k1.\n\nGood, that's my correction, replacing the bad nominal split.\n\nRow 38 (n=102): same as row 10. L8.\n\nRow 39 (n=103): same as row 11. L8.\n\nRow 40 (n=104): same as row 12. L8.\n\nNow rows 41-46.",
