    "text": "Good: no row has more than one unreferenced clause, so every subordinate clause is tied to something. No L6 candidates.\n\nNow let me also check that in each sop, words are covered (the program checked, so trust).\n\nOne last sanity check on my 4 corrections: ensure every word of the text appears exactly once, and check syntax validity. Let me write a checker for word coverage on my corrections.\n\nn=33 text: \"I want my avatar to be a male figure for every session from now on, not only for the diagram I have open right now.\"\nWords: I, want, my, avatar, to, be, a, male, figure, for, every, session, from, now, on, not, only, for, the, diagram, I, have, open, right, now.\nMy corrected sop: n1 I; c1 want; n2 my avatar; r1 to; c2 be + negation not + modifier only + modifier on; n3 a male figure; r2 for; n4 every session; r3 from; n5 now; r4 for; n6 the diagram; n7 I; c3 have + open, right, now; r5. All covered exactly once. \n\nn=101 text: \"Please make a woman figure my avatar, because that is how people know me here and I do not want it to change.\"\nWords: Please, make, a, woman, figure, my, avatar, because, that, is, how, people, know, me, here, and, I, do, not, want, it, to, change.\nMy sop: c1 imperative Please make complement n1 n2; n1 a woman figure; n2 my avatar; r1 because→k1; n3 that; c2 is; c3 how know here subject people complement me; k1 and c2 c4; n6 I; c4 do not want; n7 it; r2 to→c5; c5 change subject n7; r3 c2→c3.\nCovered: Please, make, a, woman, figure, my, avatar, because, that, is, how, people, know, me, here, and, I, do, not, want, it, to, change. Yes all 23. Good. Note c3's \"how\" as modifier — fine.\n\nn=165 text: \"I want my avatar to be an older man for every session from now on, not only for the diagram I have open right now.\" — an, older, man in n3. Covered.\n\nn=349 text: \"Please make the robot but painted blue my avatar, because that is how people know me here and I do not want it to change.\"\nWords: Please, make, the, robot, but, painted, blue, my, avatar, because, that, is, how, people, know, me, here, and, I, do, not, want, it, to, change.\nMy sop: c1 Please make complement n1 n2; n1 the robot; c2 nonfinite painted modifier blue; r4 marker but from n1 to c2; n2 my avatar; r1 because→k2; n3 that; c3 is; c4 how know here subject n4 people complement n5 me; k2 and c3 c5; n6 I; c5 do not want; n7 it; r2 to→c6; c6 change subject n7; r3 c3→c4. All words covered once. Good.\n\nNow sort the verdicts file by n and validate again. Then final check of file content samples.\n\nAlso I should double-check that the note for each rejection is one sentence — they are.\nAnd the sop field uses \"\\n\" escapes in JSON strings — yes since json.dumps escapes newlines.\n\nLet me sort and finalize.",
